@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam arrowThickness 1.1
skinparam arrowColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam classBackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR

Class "<<interface>>\nModel" as Model
Class ModelManager
Class AddressBook
Class UniquePersonList
Class UserPrefs
Class Person
Class Name
Class Phone
Class Email
Class Address
Class SchoolLevel
Class Subject
Class StudentNote
Class Tag
Class NextLesson
Class RecurringLesson
Class LessonDuration
Class "<<utility>>\nTimetableClashChecker" as TimetableClashChecker

Model <|.. ModelManager
ModelManager *--> "1" AddressBook
ModelManager *--> "1" UserPrefs
ModelManager --> "*" Person : filtered

AddressBook *--> "1" UniquePersonList
UniquePersonList --> "*" Person

Person *--> Name
Person *--> Phone
Person *--> Email
Person *--> Address
Person *--> SchoolLevel
Person *--> Subject
Person *--> StudentNote
Person *--> "*" Tag
Person *--> "0..1" NextLesson
Person *--> "0..1" RecurringLesson
NextLesson *--> LessonDuration
RecurringLesson *--> LessonDuration

TimetableClashChecker ..> Person
@enduml
